# Results are not tracked, except the small files the notebooks need to reproduce the paper's tables and
# figures without retraining (see README.md).
*
!.gitignore
!*/
# 14 bus (experiments/compare_survival.ipynb)
!2026_10_28_compare_graph_obs_spaces_IEEE14/*/.hydra/overrides.yaml
!2026_10_28_compare_graph_obs_spaces_IEEE14/**/analysis/survival/*.npy
!2026_10_28_compare_graph_obs_spaces_IEEE14/**/analysis/survival/summary.json
!2026_10_28_compare_graph_obs_spaces_IEEE14/**/analysis/training_curve.csv
# 36 bus (experiments/graph_comparison_36bus_results.ipynb, slurm/unicluster/graph_comparison_36bus_senior.sh)
!junior/graph36_*/trials.csv
!junior/graph36_*/best/config.yaml
!junior/graph36_*/best/history.csv
!junior/graph36_*/best/test_metrics.json
!junior/graph36_*/best/trial.txt
!senior/2026_11_11_IEEE36_graph_comparison_senior_v2/**/rollout/episodes_*.csv
!senior/2026_11_11_IEEE36_graph_comparison_senior_v2/**/trained_on.txt
!senior/2026_11_11_IEEE36_graph_comparison_senior_v2/**/checkpoint_selection.json
